WEBVTT

00:00:01.412 --> 00:00:04.241
iz hot men zey avekgeshtelt antkegn vant

00:00:02.762 --> 00:00:05.068
m'hot undz avekgeshtelt, ile dray

00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:09.152
un teykef oysgeshosn.

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.358
zenen efsher geven

00:00:13.174 --> 00:00:14.990
a zibn akht meter fun undz.

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:22.089
ikh veys nisht vos iz geshen mit mir in der minut.

00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:23.849
ikh bin ⟨farshtartset⟩ gevorn.

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.536
kh'hob nisht gefilt keyn shrek.

00:00:26.536 --> 00:00:28.220
kh'hob nisht gefilt keyn moyre.

00:00:29.813 --> 00:00:33.249
un ikh hob nor gekukt azoy, azoy vi ikh kuk in himl arayn.

00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:38.244
un dem foter un di muter hot men geshosn oyf toyt

00:00:39.043 --> 00:00:41.315
un mikh hot men getrofn UNK.

00:00:43.347 --> 00:00:45.416
geven a HALF INCH LOWER

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.103
I WOULD BE DEAD.

00:00:50.535 --> 00:00:51.980
in a por teg arum

00:00:52.088 --> 00:00:53.786
nokh dem vos s'iz geshe- ikh bin

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.710
ikh bin geven PASSED OUT.

00:00:59.277 --> 00:01:01.178
in a por teg arum

00:01:02.685 --> 00:01:05.227
emetser fun der ⟨oylem⟩ zenen durkhgan dortn arum

00:01:06.162 --> 00:01:07.388
un zey hobn gezen

00:01:07.528 --> 00:01:09.412
az Borekh un Perl

00:01:09.638 --> 00:01:10.627
un ikh

00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:12.365
me valgert zikh lebn der vant.

00:01:14.093 --> 00:01:17.228
iz keyner nisht gevezn arum UNK me zol zen, me zol

00:01:17.228 --> 00:01:18.423
fun di zelners m-

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:21.646
iz er tsugan. m'hot ongehoybn tsu muntern.

00:01:23.627 --> 00:01:24.414
toyt.

00:01:27.357 --> 00:01:28.262
⟨bay mikh⟩

00:01:29.128 --> 00:01:32.632
⟨epes⟩ hob ikh gegibn a, zey hobn mir dertseylt dernokh dem az ikh hob gegibn a krekhts.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.434
ven m'hot getshepet mikh, hob ikh gegibn a krekhts.

00:01:37.971 --> 00:01:40.530
m'hot mikh avekgenu- mikh hot men avekgenumen

00:01:41.346 --> 00:01:44.681
tsun a mol- tsun a goy in der shtub

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.291
un s'iz geven a

00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.170
⟨veys vos⟩ s'iz geven. s'heyst a feldsher

00:01:49.699 --> 00:01:50.942
veyst vos heyst a feldsher?

00:01:52.247 --> 00:01:53.608
un m'hot im gebrakht

00:01:55.909 --> 00:01:57.691
un er hot mikh ongehoybn tsu

00:01:57.867 --> 00:01:58.823
rateven.

00:01:59.993 --> 00:02:03.058
kh'hob gehat a ⟨LITTLE⟩ INFECTION. s'iz do der simen UNK

00:02:04.566 --> 00:02:05.516
un m'hot mikh

00:02:05.516 --> 00:02:07.124
dermuntert UNK.

00:02:07.806 --> 00:02:10.941
un s'hot genumen nokh a, a dray vokhn

00:02:10.941 --> 00:02:13.014
biz ikh bin gekumen tsu zikh.

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:15.697
ikh hob gekent shoyn geyn, ikh hob gekent shoyn

00:02:16.598 --> 00:02:18.195
hobn zey mir gekent di geshikhte.

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:21.687
di eltern zenen zey mekaber gevezn

00:02:22.099 --> 00:02:25.639
nisht dortn. m'hot dos, m'iz, m'hot zey mekaber geven oyf an ander plats.

00:02:25.639 --> 00:02:28.100
m'hot undz dernokh dem, m'hot mir gevizn vu dos iz.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.614
dernokh dem ⟨shoyn⟩ UNK

00:02:30.891 --> 00:02:32.268
hot zikh geendikt di milkhome

00:02:34.198 --> 00:02:36.132
un ikh hob shoyn nisht gehat

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:38.967
kh'hob nisht vuhin tsu geyn. ikh bin shoyn aleyn

00:02:39.345 --> 00:02:41.161
ikh veys nisht gornisht vos tut zikh

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:44.402
un m'hot mikh moyre tsu haltn.

00:02:46.737 --> 00:02:48.657
m'hot mikh moyre tsu haltn. "THAT'S IT.

00:02:48.657 --> 00:02:49.245
GO."

00:02:49.605 --> 00:02:53.244
vi lang hot gedoyert biz vanen zey hobn aykh UNK

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:55.792
mh biz m'hot mir gebrakht tsu ⟨zikh⟩, s'iz a min a dray, dray mit a halbn vokhn.

00:02:56.828 --> 00:02:59.606
vos iz der feldsher's nomen geven? gedenkt ir?

00:02:59.359 --> 00:03:00.247
ikh gedenk nisht.

00:03:02.059 --> 00:03:02.812
gedenk nisht.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.892
a sakh

00:03:03.915 --> 00:03:08.819
goyim vos zey hobn undz geholfn, a sakh geholfn, gedenk nisht zeyere nemen.

00:03:10.817 --> 00:03:15.063
ikh hob mikh gelozt geyn vider a mol in der geto, nor ikh bin shoyn nisht gan dortn ⟨arum⟩.

00:03:16.605 --> 00:03:18.202
ikh bin shoyn gan an ander veg.

00:03:19.373 --> 00:03:23.552
un ikh bin tsugekumen biz tsu dem shtot Ribnitse

00:03:23.878 --> 00:03:25.492
un ikh bin geven efsher

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.108
a dray hundert meter fun der geto

00:03:30.662 --> 00:03:33.744
iz oyfn ponem iz ongeshribn az du bist di, ikh bin a yid.

00:03:35.083 --> 00:03:39.616
iz a politsey, fun di eygene, fun di, dortn fun di goyim.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.701
"ver bistu? vos bistu?"

