ikh hob nisht keyn papirn. redn redt a yid, ober ikh hob nisht keyn papirn.

00:03:52.009 --> 00:03:54.973
hot er mikh arestirt, un ⟨er hot⟩ mikh arayngefirt in der zhandarmeri.

00:03:55.637 --> 00:03:56.829
s'iz geven di

00:03:57.831 --> 00:03:58.837
POLICE.

