un me shikt mikh avek keyn Tiraspol.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:20.235
vi azoy hobn zey gemakht a bilbl? vos far a shpyon? fun vanen zayt ir?

00:04:18.553 --> 00:04:22.411
azo- azoy UNK kh'hob nisht gehat keyn shum papirn.

00:04:22.738 --> 00:04:23.638
UNK

00:04:23.638 --> 00:04:26.098
s'iz geven azoy. se, se fleg zikh a- z-

00:04:26.098 --> 00:04:28.358
tsu gikh baytn di

00:04:28.358 --> 00:04:29.748
s'iz geven a moment vos

00:04:29.748 --> 00:04:32.691
s'iz gekumen tsu k- geyn mayn mume

00:04:32.691 --> 00:04:37.666
mit, mit der shvester, der el- mit der elterer tokhter

