00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.373
me tor nisht.

00:04:54.885 --> 00:04:57.106
me darf mishpetn.

00:04:57.619 --> 00:05:01.573
Rumenye hot zikh far der tsayt ongehoybn a bisele shoyn tsu, tsu

00:05:01.573 --> 00:05:03.890
kukn tsu, tsu England

00:05:04.099 --> 00:05:07.890
un yene, az s'hot shoyn ongehoybn a bisele tsu makhn gringer far di yidn

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:10.252
un me shikt mikh avek keyn Tiraspol.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:14.556
Tiraspol, dos iz a min a

00:05:15.388 --> 00:05:17.559
⟨A HUNDRED⟩ tsen MILES fun Ribnitse

