un s'iz geven a mishpet.

00:05:28.387 --> 00:05:29.524
m'hot mikh gemishpet.

00:05:30.154 --> 00:05:32.679
un far derfar vos ikh bin geven a kind

00:05:33.529 --> 00:05:35.852
hot men mir gegibn tsen yor tfise

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.209
un m'hot mikh avekgeshikt in JAIL.

00:05:41.258 --> 00:05:43.412
ikh bin gekumen k- in JAIL

