BUT THE WORST THING iz gevezn

00:06:16.223 --> 00:06:17.989
di S.S.n vos zey hobn gegibn.

00:06:18.096 --> 00:06:20.556
geven ful, koy- koydem kol nisht geven keyn zalts.

00:06:20.556 --> 00:06:21.768
on zalts.

