00:06:34.926 --> 00:06:35.947
on zalts

00:06:35.947 --> 00:06:37.997
un mit vos du vilst iz dortn geven

00:06:37.997 --> 00:06:38.930
ineveynik.

00:06:39.055 --> 00:06:41.782
iz geven farsh- farfoylt, in gantsn farshtunken

00:06:42.092 --> 00:06:43.520
UNK gegibn a shtikl

00:06:43.847 --> 00:06:46.425
azoy vi dos ot o, un dos iz dos gevezn

00:06:46.425 --> 00:06:51.671
mit a bisele LIKE A SOUP, BUT s'iz gevezn nisht keyn SOUP. s'iz geven UNK, un fun farfoylte PEA

