dos iz geven, az s'iz geven eyn PEA, tsvey PEA, dos iz geven gut.

00:06:56.449 --> 00:06:57.627
on zalts.

00:06:59.794 --> 00:07:02.420
un in dray un fertsikstn yor

00:07:03.085 --> 00:07:07.972
iz geven epes a, a AMNESTY. ikh veys nisht vos iz dortn far a gedule geven bay zey

00:07:08.434 --> 00:07:10.419
i- hot men mikh aroysgelozt.

00:07:12.298 --> 00:07:15.093
mikh aroysgelozt, un m'hot mikh avekgeshikt keyn Ribnitse

00:07:15.285 --> 00:07:16.629
in der geto.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:22.079
in MAY khoydesh, ⟨fun⟩ MAY khoydesh, dray un fertsikstn yor

00:07:22.812 --> 00:07:23.869
biz

00:07:24.313 --> 00:07:26.242
APRIL THE TENTH, ikh

00:07:26.242 --> 00:07:27.918
gedenk es shtark gut.

00:07:28.667 --> 00:07:30.832
bin geven in der geto bay der mume.

00:07:30.832 --> 00:07:31.563
mit der mume.

