00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.937
dem feter's a shvester mit fir kinder

00:07:43.011 --> 00:07:45.826
un s'iz geven nokh UNK iz geven

00:07:45.826 --> 00:07:47.561
epes a tsvelef mentshn

00:07:48.259 --> 00:07:49.620
a

00:07:50.082 --> 00:07:51.865
klener tsimer vi dos

00:07:52.866 --> 00:07:54.007
⟨zenen mir⟩ gevezn.

00:07:54.688 --> 00:07:58.752
der feter hot gearbet kovaleray bay, bay

00:07:58.752 --> 00:08:02.191
fleg er arbetn oykhet far PRODUCT, far FOOD

00:08:02.552 --> 00:08:04.740
un dos iz gevezn di, di

00:08:05.286 --> 00:08:06.579
iz a sakh mol

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:10.258
vifl mentshn zaynen geven i- in, in gantsn geto?

00:08:08.222 --> 00:08:09.397
in der geto?

00:08:09.758 --> 00:08:12.553
in gantsn geto zenen mir gevezn

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.726
bay di onderhalbn toyznt nisht. nisht geven keyn groyse geto.

00:08:16.288 --> 00:08:19.387
un s'iz geven dortn a yudnrat? ir gedenkt

00:08:18.568 --> 00:08:19.508
YES.

00:08:19.508 --> 00:08:24.179
nor ikh gedenk nisht ver s'iz gevezn di, m'hot zey ile dernokh dem ayngezetst ven es zenen gekumen di rusn, hot men zey

00:08:24.186 --> 00:08:25.935
ayn- s'iz geven yudnrat, YES.

