00:08:28.253 --> 00:08:34.240
NO, s- ikh hob nisht gezen keyn yidishe pol- me zo- mh, s'iz yo gevezn, nor ikh hob nisht gezen. kh'hob

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.634
UNK s'iz geven a

00:08:37.062 --> 00:08:39.756
vi azoy heyst es? a MAYOR n- fun der yudnrat

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:42.962
un, AND THAT'S IT.

00:08:43.086 --> 00:08:44.514
un s'iz geven dor-

00:08:43.288 --> 00:08:44.480
m'hot getrib-

00:08:44.588 --> 00:08:47.400
s'iz dortn geven yidn fun Besarabye oykh?

00:08:47.119 --> 00:08:48.075
s'iz geven yo.

00:08:48.132 --> 00:08:49.374
iz vi

00:08:48.368 --> 00:08:51.247
s'iz geven funem arum un arum vos iz gevezn

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:52.851
iz men gevezn dort.

00:08:52.502 --> 00:08:58.149
iz vi zaynen geven di batsiungen tsvishn di besarabishe yidn un di yidn fun di derfer?

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.921
s'iz nisht geven keyn DIFFERENT, BECAUSE mir ze'mir ile geven oyf eyn lage.

00:09:00.889 --> 00:09:04.410
