00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:09.489
un m'hot undz ile getribn oyf arbetn, oyf shverste arbetn flegn mit tu- dos tun

00:09:09.748 --> 00:09:11.247
shteyner trogn

00:09:11.247 --> 00:09:15.834
grobn erd un, un keyn shum esn nisht gibn

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:17.994
un

00:09:18.473 --> 00:09:23.614
AND THAT'S IT. ven nisht der feter zol geven unterhaltn a bisl, voltn mir geven oysgeshtorbn far hunger.

00:09:24.345 --> 00:09:27.123
s'iz geven dortn frume yidn oykh in geto?

00:09:26.623 --> 00:09:28.726
n- s'iz geven eyn frumer yid.

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:35.054
er iz dernokh dem do gevorn a reb- a, a rebe, Khaim Zalmen. efsher hot ir gehert fun im un efsher nisht.

00:09:35.162 --> 00:09:36.556
er iz a satmarer.

00:09:38.115 --> 00:09:39.678
iz

00:09:40.697 --> 00:09:43.323
eyn, eyn frumer yid iz geven.

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:49.182
hob dernokh der milkhome hob ikh gehat mit im gute

00:09:49.182 --> 00:09:51.241
far- farbindungen. ikh fleg geyn

00:09:51.241 --> 00:09:52.234
geyn tsun im.

00:09:54.214 --> 00:09:56.351
un azoy, er hot mir gekent far a kind.

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:58.629
dos iz geven eyn yid.

00:09:58.905 --> 00:09:59.759
NO MORE.

00:09:59.952 --> 00:10:02.932
fun undzer zayt iz di, oyber du fregst

00:10:02.932 --> 00:10:05.992
fun RELIGIOUS, mir ze'mir nisht gevezn fun

00:10:05.992 --> 00:10:10.576
s'iz geven, di eltere mentshn hobn gegleybt. mir ze'mir gegleybt in zikh. m'hot nisht

00:10:11.713 --> 00:10:13.209
m'hot nisht

00:10:13.333 --> 00:10:16.719
un akhuts dem hot men gehat taynes. oyb s'iz do a got

00:10:17.248 --> 00:10:19.722
