00:10:20.944 --> 00:10:22.980
reboyne shel oylem, vuhin kukstu?

00:10:23.188 --> 00:10:24.903
kuk vos tut zikh arum undz.

00:10:25.348 --> 00:10:26.641
kuk vos tut zikh.

00:10:28.032 --> 00:10:29.291
zoy hot men gekent gleybn?

00:10:31.913 --> 00:10:33.274
dos iz geven di problem.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:37.847
in nayntsn in, in tsentn APRIL

00:10:39.979 --> 00:10:42.099
iz, hot men undz bafrayt.

00:10:44.215 --> 00:10:46.926
s'iz geven in Ribnitse iz gevezn

00:10:47.269 --> 00:10:50.368
akhuts der geto iz gevezn a groyse

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.883
tfise.

00:10:54.238 --> 00:10:55.177
a JAIL.

00:10:55.723 --> 00:10:57.691
MOST OF THE PEOPLE iz gevezn yidn.

00:10:59.706 --> 00:11:02.166
iz eyder zey hobn gedarft avekgeyn

00:11:02.166 --> 00:11:03.327
di daytshn

00:11:03.688 --> 00:11:06.922
iz men arayngegangen in der tfise. m'hot oysgeshosn ile mentshn

00:11:08.582 --> 00:11:11.580
m'hot

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.301
ongetsundn di tfise

00:11:13.392 --> 00:11:14.348
dem JAIL

00:11:15.231 --> 00:11:17.722
THAT'S IT. s'iz nisht geblibn keyn UNK gornisht.

00:11:18.049 --> 00:11:19.831
farbrent, un THAT'S it.

00:11:20.766 --> 00:11:22.003
un in Tiraspol

00:11:22.003 --> 00:11:22.729
oykhet.

00:11:22.729 --> 00:11:25.924
dort in der tfise vu ikh bin ongezetst hot men di zelbedike

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:33.680
dos zelbedike. es iz gevezn, az m'hot gezogt az s'iz APPROXIMATELY ABOUT a tsol mh tsen THOUSAND, toyznt mentshn

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.036
zenen umgekumen dort

00:11:36.595 --> 00:11:37.652
in der tfise.

00:11:38.181 --> 00:11:40.537
⟨vos⟩ m'hot zey oysgeshosn un zey farbrent.

00:11:42.518 --> 00:11:47.543
heyst dos az ven ir hot, ven aykh hot men gelozt fray geyn fun Tiraspol

00:11:47.543 --> 00:11:50.983
hot men nit aroysgelozn ale di mentshn. nor zelner?

00:11:49.538 --> 00:11:52.805
NO, NO, NO, NO. mikh als a kind

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:56.518
hot men amnestirt. no- sh- nisht, nisht ale.

00:11:56.659 --> 00:12:02.998
m'hot amnestirt etlekhe goyim moldovaner vos iz nisht keyn, zey hobn nisht geton keyn shtark shvere CRIME

00:12:03.342 --> 00:12:05.557
un etlekhe mentshn. ge- getseylte.

00:12:05.557 --> 00:12:06.676
A FEW PEOPLE.

00:12:08.235 --> 00:12:10.946
THAT'S IT. THIS IS THE STORY fun d- fun der milkhome.

00:12:11.273 --> 00:12:18.118
vi azoy, ven zey zenen arayngegangen, di, di rusn, avu zayt ir geven, un vi g- ir hot gevust foroys?

00:12:16.656 --> 00:12:18.070
ikh bin geven in Ribnitse.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:19.510
geven in geto.

00:12:19.069 --> 00:12:20.514
un, un z-

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:23.650
mir ho'mir, s'iz, s'iz, zey hobn gezogt az s'iz, mir ze'mir

00:12:23.929 --> 00:12:28.141
mir ho'mir zikh geleygt shlofn mitn daytsh, un mir zenen oyfgeshtanen mit di, mit di rusn.

00:12:28.823 --> 00:12:31.500
in der fri zenen shoyn geven di rusn in sh- in shtot.

00:12:31.354 --> 00:12:35.094
un emetser hot gehat an anung az zey kumen, tsi ir hot

00:12:34.594 --> 00:12:37.924
yo, yo, vayl s'iz geven, s'iz gan d- der f- di, di

00:12:37.924 --> 00:12:40.714
der front vos iz geven UNK di milkhome.

00:12:41.007 --> 00:12:46.586
s'iz, m'hot UNK, m'hot gevorfn di bombes. m'hot, s'iz geven geferlekh.

00:12:46.423 --> 00:12:49.758
un vi hobn di rusn aykh bagrist, un vi ir zey?

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:54.231
ah, ikh ken dir zogn dem emes, ikh hob mikh nisht

00:12:56.211 --> 00:12:58.584
ikh hob nisht gehat mit zey afile keyn

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.900
vos zol ikh dir zogn?

00:13:00.396 --> 00:13:03.731
UNK ze'mir geven mit zey arumnemen zikh un tsekushn zikh.

00:13:06.572 --> 00:13:07.747
kh'hob teykef

00:13:08.007 --> 00:13:10.195
oyfn tsveytn tog bin ikh avekgan in dorf arayn.

00:13:15.178 --> 00:13:17.703
oyfn tsveytn tog, dem eleftn APRIL

00:13:18.874 --> 00:13:20.454
bin ikh shoyn avek in dorf arayn.

00:13:20.697 --> 00:13:22.598
un avu iz di tante geblibn?

00:13:22.215 --> 00:13:23.542
dortn in Ribnitse.

00:13:24.088 --> 00:13:27.592
di tante un di, ⟨un ale⟩.

00:13:29.792 --> 00:13:32.874
iz vos hot ir gefunen az ir hot gekumen tsurik in dorf?

00:13:32.374 --> 00:13:37.936
az ikh bin gekumen tsurik in dorf iz in undzer shtub hot gevoynt a, a goyishe FAMILY.

00:13:38.719 --> 00:13:40.805
fun undzere zakhn iz gornisht geblibn.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.759
umkern hot men dos gornisht umgekert

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:49.766
vu iz geven zeyer bagegenish fa- mit aykh az ir zayt tsu- arayn tsu zikh in shtub?

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:52.941
mh nisht azoy shtark, nisht azoy shtark freylekh, vayl zey hobn gemeynt az mir ze'mir ale umgekumen

00:13:52.941 --> 00:13:56.769
zey hobn gevust az di eltern zenen ah geshosn gevorn

00:13:56.927 --> 00:13:58.949
un nor ikh

00:13:58.949 --> 00:14:03.654
vos ikh bin geblibn do- iz oykhet zenen zey nisht geven zikher az ikh bin lebedik

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:07.850
tsi ikh bin tsugan keyn, atintsu vu ikh bin avekgan

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.030
bin avekgan. THAT'S IT.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:12.622
di brider zenen gevorn, geven in der armey, zenen geven oyf der milkhome.

00:14:15.287 --> 00:14:17.475
ikh bin gekumen in dorf, iz gevezn

00:14:18.105 --> 00:14:21.811
hob ikh gevoynt a b- a bisele tsayt hob ikh gevoynt mit zey, ⟨ober⟩ zey hobn nisht gehat vu tsu voynen.

00:14:22.273 --> 00:14:23.920
un zey hobn mikh gehodevet.

00:14:24.332 --> 00:14:25.288
di brider?

00:14:25.024 --> 00:14:25.941
NO.

00:14:25.941 --> 00:14:30.047
di goy- UNK yo, di goyim vos ho- vos zenen, zey hobn gevoynt bay undz in shtub

00:14:26.003 --> 00:14:27.937
di mentshn di goyim?

00:14:31.032 --> 00:14:33.405
dernokh dem zenen zey avekgan fun der shtub.

00:14:34.609 --> 00:14:36.054
hob ikh ongehoybn tsu hungern.

00:14:38.811 --> 00:14:40.256
iz avekgan

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.939
ikh gedenk nisht vifl tsayt avekgan

00:14:43.266 --> 00:14:46.905
iz gekumen, in shtetl keyn Rashkev iz gekumen

00:14:48.126 --> 00:14:50.482
a AUNT, mayn

00:14:50.708 --> 00:14:53.436
pape's bruder's, mayn foter's bruder's vayb.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.966
zi iz gekumen in dorf

00:14:56.766 --> 00:15:01.282
zi v- zi hot gevolt visn vos, vos hert zikh? ver iz geblibn lebedik un

00:15:01.592 --> 00:15:03.898
mir ho'mir zikh nisht gezen SINCE

00:15:03.904 --> 00:15:05.563
ven s'hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome.

00:15:05.563 --> 00:15:06.868
hot zi mir getrofn.

00:15:07.296 --> 00:15:11.863
mir getrofn. zi hot gezen mayn, in vos far a lage ikh gefin mikh, hot zi mikh farnumen mit zikh.

00:15:13.489 --> 00:15:15.693
mikh farnumen mit zikh, un ikh bin geven

00:15:16.172 --> 00:15:17.550
in Rashkev

00:15:19.277 --> 00:15:21.718
biz mayn bruder hot mir gefunen, der elterer.

00:15:23.378 --> 00:15:25.262
vi azoy hot er aykh gefunen?

00:15:25.453 --> 00:15:29.618
 er hot ongeshribn funem, fun der milkhome

00:15:29.618 --> 00:15:31.725
hot er ongeshribn a briv in dorf arayn

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.159
tsum MAYOR

00:15:33.317 --> 00:15:34.408
funem dorf

00:15:35.241 --> 00:15:40.314
un der MAYOR hot gevust vu ikh gefin mikh in Rashkev bay der mumen. er hot zi gekent

00:15:40.523 --> 00:15:42.052
hot er ibergegebn di briv

00:15:43.054 --> 00:15:46.575
un kh'hob mikh ongehoybn tsu shraybn mitn bruder, mitn eltern.

00:15:47.205 --> 00:15:48.822
der tsveyter bruder

00:15:48.822 --> 00:15:51.317
hot shpeter a bisele ongeshribn a briv

00:15:51.897 --> 00:15:54.473
un dortn shoyn geven a bisele

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:57.105
MORE TRAGIC. vos zhe iz geven MORE TRAGIC?

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.011
er hot ongeshribn a briv

00:15:59.524 --> 00:16:01.695
un tsugezogt az tomer

00:16:02.005 --> 00:16:06.490
hobn zey derlozt az emetser fun der, fun der FAMILY zol umkumen

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:08.462
vet er umbrengen dos gantse dorf

00:16:09.497 --> 00:16:12.444
un er iz geven aza bokher vos er iz, er hot dos gekent tun.

00:16:12.855 --> 00:16:14.924
velkher bruder iz dos geven?

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:16.461
Dovid. der ⟨mitlsdiker⟩.

00:16:17.715 --> 00:16:19.092
⟨geven aza⟩

00:16:19.521 --> 00:16:21.264
hot men zikh shtark dershrokn

00:16:21.264 --> 00:16:24.746
un m'iz gekumen tsu mir a gantse DELEGATION

00:16:25.326 --> 00:16:28.926
un "gib a kuk. vos zenen mir shuldik? s'iz nisht undzer FAULT

00:16:28.926 --> 00:16:30.011
⟨vos⟩ iz geshen"

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:34.888
hob ikh im ongeshribn a, ikh hob shoyn gehat di adrese v- UNK oyfn front

00:16:35.552 --> 00:16:39.376
⟨der milkhome⟩. hob ikh im ongeshribn. ikh hob im gegibn tsu farshteyn dos.

00:16:39.923 --> 00:16:44.501
s'iz, s'iz geshen azoy un azoy un azoy UNK undzere elter zenen umgekumen. s'iz gekumen

00:16:44.501 --> 00:16:45.671
umgekumen

00:16:46.639 --> 00:16:49.772
ABOUT ikh veys, NINETY PERCENT

00:16:49.997 --> 00:16:52.454
fun undzere fraynt, fun undzere RELATIVES

00:16:55.077 --> 00:16:56.961
dos iz geshen. mir ze'mir geblibn

00:16:58.283 --> 00:16:59.441
shtark vintsik.

00:17:04.155 --> 00:17:07.794
ikh hob, bin opgeven bay der mumen, bin ikh opgevezn

00:17:07.885 --> 00:17:09.248
a

00:17:09.248 --> 00:17:10.358
por khadoshim

00:17:11.074 --> 00:17:12.215
neyn, ⟨merert⟩

00:17:12.676 --> 00:17:16.720
biz in SPRING NINETEEN FORTY FIVE.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.838
mayn bruder

00:17:19.838 --> 00:17:26.525
iz gevezn, zey hobn gedarft iberfirn dem, er hot gedint in di, di letste yor hot er gedint in

00:17:26.717 --> 00:17:29.208
AIRPORT mit, mit di

00:17:29.248 --> 00:17:31.166
mit di fliers hot er gehat tsu tun

00:17:31.881 --> 00:17:34.862
hobn zey fun eyn plats ibergefloygn oyf an anders

00:17:35.222 --> 00:17:38.540
un hot er zikh opgebetn bay di, zayne

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.256
COMMANDERS

00:17:40.256 --> 00:17:42.438
me zol im erloybn, er iz, s'iz geven noent

00:17:43.035 --> 00:17:46.168
az er zol oyf a tsvey dray teg zikh araynkhapn

00:17:46.663 --> 00:17:49.559
un zen vos i- vos iz, vos iz geshen.

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:53.711
iz er gekumen tsu un hot mir getrofn vu ikh bin geven UNK bay der mume.

00:17:54.983 --> 00:17:57.980
vos iz geven der gefil ayerer zen ayer bruder?

00:17:59.725 --> 00:18:01.238
IT'S HARD TO EXPLAIN.

00:18:03.218 --> 00:18:05.541
s'iz geven vi, far mir iz dos geven vi

00:18:05.952 --> 00:18:07.616
gekumen fun yener velt.

00:18:11.554 --> 00:18:12.948
s'iz geven

00:18:13.579 --> 00:18:16.222
er hot mir nisht gekent helfn mit gornisht. er hot gornisht gehat

00:18:16.465 --> 00:18:19.429
mir zoln mir epes iberlozn, UNK.

00:18:21.021 --> 00:18:22.972
kh'hob, far der tsayt

00:18:23.164 --> 00:18:24.828
hob ikh ongehoybn tsu arbetn

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.111
tsebislekh

00:18:26.758 --> 00:18:29.469
kh'hob gearbet, kh'hob mikh oysgelernt tsu makhn HATS

00:18:29.998 --> 00:18:32.523
hob ikh ongehoybn tsu, hob ikh nisht gehat keyn mashin

00:18:32.901 --> 00:18:34.329
keyn SEWING MACHINE

00:18:35.517 --> 00:18:42.109
fleg ikh avekgeyn in di derfer, gehat bay emetsn, ver s'hot gehat a SEWING MACHINE fleg ikh betn me zol mir erloybn

00:18:42.385 --> 00:18:43.914
fleg ikh makhn

00:18:44.393 --> 00:18:46.766
ikh fleg

00:18:47.025 --> 00:18:48.386
handlen a bisl

00:18:48.949 --> 00:18:50.242
SPECULATION

00:18:50.839 --> 00:18:53.224
fleg avekgeyn brengen fun eyn plats

00:18:53.224 --> 00:18:58.596
zalts, fleg koyfn, fardinen epes in an ander plats. melets

00:18:58.956 --> 00:19:00.857
azelkhe zakhn, kleynikeytn

00:19:02.483 --> 00:19:04.673
nor ANYWAY, s'iz geven vintsik far mir.

00:19:05.503 --> 00:19:06.627
vos hob ikh gekent tun?

00:19:09.132 --> 00:19:11.421
un dernokh dem in

00:19:14.397 --> 00:19:19.791
g- ir zayt geven der eyntsiker mitn mume in shtub, tsi dos iz geven andere? ver nokh iz geven mitn mume?

00:19:20.168 --> 00:19:23.480
i- in Rashkev zayt ir dort geven bay di mume, neyn?

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:23.672
yo, yo.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:26.738
iz ver nokh iz geven in, in shtub mit aykh?

00:19:26.462 --> 00:19:29.105
oh, s'iz geven sh- di, ire kinder.

00:19:30.445 --> 00:19:32.076
un zey zaynen geven

00:19:30.546 --> 00:19:36.092
⟨un ⟩ tsvey kinder vos zenen, vos zenen ESCAPED, zenen geblibn lebn funem, UNK oykhet geven in a

00:19:36.098 --> 00:19:37.881
CONCENTRATION CAMP, in an andern

00:19:39.996 --> 00:19:43.230
zenen geven oykhet oyf, oyf, zey hobn aleyn nisht gehat vos tsu esn.

00:19:45.582 --> 00:19:47.095
⟨nu⟩, s'iz

00:19:46.864 --> 00:19:48.650
iz ven hot ir detsidirt

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.938
ir zayt, vi lang zayt ir geblibn dortn biz UNK?

00:19:51.437 --> 00:19:53.101
ikh bin gevezn

00:19:53.496 --> 00:19:55.616
APPROXIMATELY a l- ariber a yor

00:19:55.808 --> 00:19:57.287
SOMETHING LIKE THAT

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.446
un

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.227
⟨ergets⟩ september finef un fertsik

00:20:03.435 --> 00:20:04.858
un efsher far dem

00:20:04.858 --> 00:20:05.937
efsher oygust

00:20:05.937 --> 00:20:09.152
hob ikh bakumen a briv funem eltern bruder az er hot khasene gehat.

00:20:09.152 --> 00:20:12.845
er iz geven, ⟨in tsayt fun⟩ milkhome iz er gevezn INJURED

00:20:12.936 --> 00:20:14.246
un m'hot im

00:20:14.455 --> 00:20:18.144
BECAUSE di INJURY hot men im aroysgevorfn fun der ARMY

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:21.249
un er iz gevezn in UZBEKISTAN

00:20:21.897 --> 00:20:25.536
un er hot dortn zikh bakent mit a yidishn meydl fun Besarabye, fun Belts

00:20:25.744 --> 00:20:27.408
un hot khasene gehat far ir

00:20:28.174 --> 00:20:30.564
un zi iz gekumen tsu forn keyn

00:20:30.942 --> 00:20:32.691
keyn Besarabye, keyn Belts

00:20:32.832 --> 00:20:35.036
hot er mir ongeshribn ikh zol forn tsun ir

00:20:35.278 --> 00:20:37.814
un zol shoyn zayn bay ir biz

00:20:37.814 --> 00:20:42.815
biz er vet, er vet zikh bafrayen fun der ARMY, un mir veln shoyn zen vos mir ho'mir tsu tun.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.194
un azoy hob ikh geton.

00:20:45.268 --> 00:20:49.396
ikh bin avekgan atin keyn Belts

00:20:50.702 --> 00:20:52.215
un

00:20:52.812 --> 00:20:54.814
zi iz geven mit a kind, a kleyn kind

00:20:56.592 --> 00:20:57.868
NOTHING TO EAT

00:20:58.954 --> 00:21:03.453
fleg ikh aroysgeyn oyfn MARKET, oyfn FREE MARKET un koyfn alte zakhn

00:21:04.033 --> 00:21:09.292
un zi hot ⟨arayngezesn⟩ nemen zey un makhn HATS, farkoyfn un

00:21:09.822 --> 00:21:13.258
dos hot gegibn a bisl meglekhkeyt tsu, tsu UNK ⟨khotsh⟩ a shtikl broyt

00:21:13.551 --> 00:21:15.283
geven VERY, VERY

00:21:15.745 --> 00:21:16.734
HARD TIME.

00:21:21.077 --> 00:21:22.691
un den vos iz geshen?

00:21:22.731 --> 00:21:26.285
den vos iz geshen?,

00:21:26.376 --> 00:21:28.648
in zeks un fertsikstn yor

00:21:29.042 --> 00:21:33.798
ikh bin geven shoyn alt UNK fertsn, bin ikh shoyn geven zibetsn yor alt, hob ikh shoyn ongehoybn

00:21:33.798 --> 00:21:36.833
zikh bagegenen mit yinglekh, mit meydlekh

00:21:37.581 --> 00:21:39.729
un

00:21:39.729 --> 00:21:42.452
kh'hob mikh bakent mit mayn vayb's shvester.

00:21:43.032 --> 00:21:48.611
UNK EVEN NOT mit di shvester nor mit ire COUSINS.

00:21:49.292 --> 00:21:50.990
geven tsvey COUSINS.

00:21:51.587 --> 00:21:54.551
un me fleg mir nokh dem bakent mit der shvester

00:21:55.418 --> 00:21:57.352
un

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:59.782
iz dos geven ale yidishe vos ⟨zey hobn zi⟩ bakent?

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:01.368
SOME WERE, nor ikh hob mikh nisht ge-

00:22:02.353 --> 00:22:05.840
n- s'hot mikh nisht geshlept afile ikh zol kukn tsu di goyim.

00:22:08.074 --> 00:22:10.768
iz vi azoy hot ir gevust ver zaynen di yidn?

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:12.602
yidish.

00:22:12.602 --> 00:22:13.738
redn yidish.

00:22:14.942 --> 00:22:16.573
⟨gekent⟩ redn yidish.

00:22:17.372 --> 00:22:19.239
Besarabye redn yidish.

00:22:20.359 --> 00:22:25.382
iz vi azoy az ir zayt grade gekumen fun a hoyz vos iz nit geven a frumer hoyz

00:22:25.776 --> 00:22:27.384
un m'hot

00:22:27.384 --> 00:22:31.035
di yontoyvim nit gehaltn, shabes nit gehaltn, iz

00:22:31.311 --> 00:22:34.497
vi azoy hot, hot aykh getsit

00:22:34.497 --> 00:22:37.110
oyf tsu zukhn a, a yidishe?

00:22:38.449 --> 00:22:40.248
nokh dem vos ikh hob ibergelebt

00:22:40.828 --> 00:22:42.425
vos ikh bin durkhgan

00:22:43.225 --> 00:22:46.729
ikh hob gezen vos dos, mayn folk iz durkhgekumen

00:22:49.738 --> 00:22:51.116
hob ikh farshtanen

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:55.304
az ikh

00:22:55.304 --> 00:22:56.550
ikh darf zayn a yid

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:59.216
un ikh darf zikh firn vi a yid

00:22:59.374 --> 00:23:01.258
un hobn a harts vi a yid

00:23:03.981 --> 00:23:05.783
un UNK

00:23:05.783 --> 00:23:08.196
nor kh'hob mikh, kh'hob mikh

00:23:08.196 --> 00:23:09.611
geklept tsu yidn.

00:23:10.731 --> 00:23:12.176
kh'hob mikh geklept tsu yidn.

00:23:13.802 --> 00:23:16.631
ven ikh hob mikh bakent mit mayn vayb's shvester

00:23:16.924 --> 00:23:19.618
hob ikh ongehoybn arayntsugeyn tsu zey in shtub arayn

00:23:20.552 --> 00:23:22.706
n- s'hot shoyn geheysn a

00:23:24.889 --> 00:23:29.912
s'iz geven FOOD. er iz geven, der foter iz geven a BUTCHER, un er hot gehat zayn kleyt, zayn yatke

00:23:30.154 --> 00:23:31.582
geven tomed

00:23:32.517 --> 00:23:33.641
vos tsu esn

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:39.378
un iz, flegn zey mir tomed, m'hot mikh nisht gelo- aroysgelozt hungerik.

00:23:44.143 --> 00:23:46.398
nu, dernokh dem

00:23:47.502 --> 00:23:51.360
geyendik mit der shvester hob ikh gezen az zi iz nisht far mir.

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:56.236
iz zi geven yinger, azoy az, z- zi hot gekukt andersh oyfn lebn.

00:23:57.272 --> 00:23:58.447
mayn vayb

00:23:59.044 --> 00:24:01.012
iz geven epes A LITTLE DIFFERENT

00:24:01.508 --> 00:24:03.696
ah, zi iz geven di ⟨COOKER⟩.

00:24:04.663 --> 00:24:08.842
di muter hot geholfn dem foter in kleyt tsu farkoyfn dos fleysh

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.580
iz zi iz geven di baleboste.

00:24:12.139 --> 00:24:15.052
ah zi iz gevezn mer SERIOUS.

00:24:17.303 --> 00:24:20.587
un azoy ah, azoy

00:24:22.669 --> 00:24:24.333
zey hobn gevust mayn lage

00:24:26.145 --> 00:24:29.227
iz tomed ven ikh fleg araynkumen

00:24:29.352 --> 00:24:31.405
az zi UNK fleg ikh a mol

00:24:31.461 --> 00:24:35.809
s'iz geven a bushe, nor kh'hob nisht gehat keyn ander ⟨oysveg⟩, fleg ikh a mol UNK arayngeyn

00:24:36.388 --> 00:24:37.563
tomed esn.

00:24:37.738 --> 00:24:38.840
FIRST OF ALL

00:24:38.840 --> 00:24:39.893
opesn.

00:24:42.632 --> 00:24:44.988
nu, un

00:24:46.699 --> 00:24:48.532
kh'hob gezen az baym bruder

00:24:48.775 --> 00:24:51.621
hob ikh nisht vos tsu tun. der bruder iz gekumen fun der ARMY

00:24:52.318 --> 00:24:54.137
un s'hot ongehoybn

00:24:54.137 --> 00:24:59.366
tsvishn zey, tsvishn, tsvishn di shvegerin hot ongehoybn a bisele makhloykes iber mir.

00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:02.623
zi hot nisht gevolt mikh ladn in shtub.

00:25:04.131 --> 00:25:05.188
SO

00:25:06.038 --> 00:25:07.922
hob ikh farshtanen az ikh darf avekgeyn.

00:25:09.092 --> 00:25:10.773
ikh darf avekgeyn fun der shtub.

00:25:11.134 --> 00:25:12.680
un vuhin zol ikh geyn?

00:25:15.690 --> 00:25:17.759
gelt hob ikh nisht oyf tsu tsoln RENT

00:25:18.441 --> 00:25:23.430
un s'hot zikh ongehoybn denstmol shvere tsaytn mit di produktn. s'iz UNK gevorn vider a mol a hunger.

00:25:24.043 --> 00:25:25.522
s'iz geven

00:25:26.828 --> 00:25:28.999
UNK hob ikh bakent mit mayn vayb

00:25:29.443 --> 00:25:30.992
hob ikh shoyn ongehoybn mit ir ts-

00:25:30.992 --> 00:25:32.474
DATEN HER, ⟨tsi azoy⟩

00:25:33.055 --> 00:25:34.449
shpatsirn mit ir.

00:25:34.641 --> 00:25:35.293
OKAY

00:25:36.497 --> 00:25:39.950
iz ikh bin ⟨opgan⟩ a, a tsvey khadoshim, dray khadoshim mit ir

00:25:40.108 --> 00:25:41.739
iz der shver mayner

00:25:41.796 --> 00:25:43.781
mikh shtark lib gehat, lib bakumen

00:25:44.344 --> 00:25:47.240
ir foter, un

00:25:47.240 --> 00:25:50.565
s'iz geven a, nisht keyn groyse shtot. geven getseylte yidn

00:25:51.077 --> 00:25:55.171
hot men shtark moyre gehat me zol nisht zogn epes shlekhts oyf der tokhter

00:25:55.954 --> 00:25:57.264
iz er gekumen

00:25:58.367 --> 00:25:59.728
mit a

00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:02.799
mh vi azoy heyst dos, a

00:26:03.126 --> 00:26:04.250
mir forgeleygt

00:26:04.662 --> 00:26:06.158
"farshteyst, mayn kind

00:26:06.265 --> 00:26:07.558
⟨kh'kum⟩ fun der shul

00:26:07.851 --> 00:26:12.738
az, di balebatim zogn az s'iz beser zol men makhn a knas mol."

00:26:13.268 --> 00:26:16.417
UNK khosn kale, dos iz sh- se ⟨tut⟩ zikh shoyn andersh

00:26:18.853 --> 00:26:22.779
nu, shoyn UNK ikh bin shoyn alt gevorn akhtsn yor.

00:26:23.410 --> 00:26:24.771
yo, far dem

00:26:26.869 --> 00:26:28.381
hob ikh

00:26:30.295 --> 00:26:32.938
far dem vos ikh hob ba- bakent mit mayn vayb

00:26:33.450 --> 00:26:38.439
bin ikh av- av- arayngeforn tsu, keyn Ribnitse. s'iz nisht vayt, a min a zekhtsn MILE

00:26:38.715 --> 00:26:43.586
bin ikh arayngeforn tsu MY mayn AUNT, mayn foter's eltere shvester

00:26:44.487 --> 00:26:47.572
un kh'hob ir der- dertseylt di geshikhte az

00:26:47.572 --> 00:26:49.745
kuk, ikh bin in aza un aza lage

00:26:50.173 --> 00:26:51.821
hob ikh gevolt khasene hobn

00:26:52.114 --> 00:26:53.728
un ikh hob a

00:26:53.987 --> 00:26:54.959
a COUSIN.

00:26:56.232 --> 00:27:00.360
⟨zi⟩ iz lebn geblibn. dos iz mayn feter Yankl's meydl, di tokhter di klenere

00:27:00.417 --> 00:27:03.735
gevoynt in di STREET, ACROSS THE STREET

00:27:05.260 --> 00:27:07.566
"vi azoy kukstu ikh zol khasene far UNK?"

00:27:07.808 --> 00:27:08.848
UNDERSTAND?

00:27:10.153 --> 00:27:12.746
di AUNT kukt oyf mir, zogt zi "du bist meshuge.

00:27:14.608 --> 00:27:18.416
vifl bist alt? bist nokh a grin yu- grin ⟨yinglke⟩ yid. oyb shoyn yo

00:27:18.979 --> 00:27:21.541
oyb shoyn yo, darfstu arayngeyn in a FAMILY

00:27:21.541 --> 00:27:23.360
az me zol fun dir makhn a mentsh.

00:27:24.868 --> 00:27:27.072
koydem kol, zi iz dayn

00:27:27.703 --> 00:27:28.527
COUSIN

00:27:28.527 --> 00:27:30.704
⟨iz⟩ bay di yidn iz nisht

00:27:31.573 --> 00:27:32.557
me tor nisht

00:27:32.783 --> 00:27:34.177
ACCORDING TO THE LAW.

00:27:35.922 --> 00:27:39.122
nu, bin ikh shoyn gekumen tsu forn keyn, tsurik in Belts

00:27:39.820 --> 00:27:41.248
un

00:27:42.300 --> 00:27:45.866
kh'hob ongehoybn mit ir zikh tsu bagegenen mit mayn froy un

00:27:45.866 --> 00:27:48.031
der shver hot mir forgeleygt dos

00:27:48.797 --> 00:27:51.603
zog ikh "ikh ze, du farsh- ze, ir farshteyt azoy tut

00:27:51.603 --> 00:27:53.755
farshteyt az mir darfn mir vern khosn kale.

00:27:53.755 --> 00:27:56.182
ikh bin nisht AGAINST."

00:27:58.365 --> 00:28:00.013
un

00:28:00.373 --> 00:28:01.683
m'hot es

00:28:02.061 --> 00:28:04.991
dem ershtn september, NINETEEN FORTY SIX

00:28:05.773 --> 00:28:07.741
hot men bashtelt di

00:28:08.490 --> 00:28:10.627
az se darf zayn di ENGAGEMENT

00:28:12.523 --> 00:28:15.132
un in dem tog, dem zelbn tog

00:28:15.898 --> 00:28:21.190
kumt mayn shver, iz geven shabes, iz kumt mayn shver fun der, fun der shul vider a mol

00:28:21.957 --> 00:28:24.240
un vider a mol mit a PROPOSITION

00:28:24.623 --> 00:28:26.037
mir geyen baytn di lente

00:28:24.740 --> 00:28:25.723
farshteyt

00:28:25.723 --> 00:28:27.129
OKAY.
